id: SHELL17-4
package: fandhe-workshop-web
test: boot_corrupt_history
target: crates/web/src/shell_notice.rs
find:         "{CORRUPT_HISTORY_HEAD}{}{CORRUPT_HISTORY_TAIL}{reason}{CORRUPT_HISTORY_GUIDE}",
replace:         "{CORRUPT_HISTORY_HEAD}{}{CORRUPT_HISTORY_TAIL}{reason}",
expect-fail: 壊れた履歴_7_種は起動時に開かず_corrupt_history_が理由つきで出て_新しい状態で始まる
note: 壊れた履歴の通知から押す操作の案内の文が消える（SHELL-17・TASK-533）
